    "text_full": "Solutions\nTools\nIntegrations\nResources\nPricing\nGet a demo\nLogin\nRegister\nLOOKING FOR A ANALYZER TOOLS ALTERNATIVE?\nAnalyzer Tools Alternative\n\nSeller Assistant is a powerful alternative to Analyzer.Tools. This all-in-one product-sourcing software offers 20+ tools to quickly find profitable and low-risk deals. Get effective solutions for automated wholesale price list scanning, brand and competitor analysis alongside comprehensive tools for in-depth product research.\n\nStart 14-day free trial\nLET'S COMPARE\nSeller Assistant vs Analyzer.Tools\n\nKey features comparison\n\nSeller Assistant\nAnalyzer.Tools\nFEATURES\nAll-in-one product sourcing at scale\n\nComprehensive product sourcing solution for wholesale, online arbitrage, and dropshipping\n\nSeller Assistant offers a wide range of product sourcing solutions for Amazon sellers engaged in bulk sourcing and single deal research. These include tools for wholesale sellers: Price List Analyzer, Brand Analyzer, Seller Spy, and Bulk Restriction Checker, and online arbitrage and dropshipping tools: Seller Assistant Extension, IP Alert, built-in VPN to efficiently source bulk and single deals both automatically and manually.\n‍\n‍Analyzer.Tools offers only wholesale solutions that don’t allow brand research, only price list scanning (Bulk Spreadsheet Scan) and competitor storefront scan (Competing Seller Scan). Competitor research does not provide competitor storefront summary offered by Seller Assistant’s Storefront Widget.\n\nWholesale price list scanning\n\nAutomates finding profitable deals on your wholesale list\n\nSeller Assistant’s Price List Analyzer helps automate finding high-margin low-risk deals by enriching your wholesale spreadsheet with key product data and applying advanced filtering. It also shows if you can sell a product on your Amazon account, product restrictions, if a product has IP complaints and Amazon policy violations, and other risks (hazmat, fragile, meltable, etc.) protecting you from account health damage and unexpected costs.\n‍\n‍Analyzer.Tools’ Bulk spreadsheet scan provides you with detailed product data, but shows limited risks (hazmat and brand alert), and doesn’t show if you can sell a product on your account or its restrictions. Offers advanced scanner features: Advanced Multi-Pack Support, Custom Favorites Lists, and Brand Blocklist.\n\n\nBrand analysis\n\nHelps understand if a brand is worth reselling\n\nSeller Assistant's Brand Analyzer gives data on brand’s product count, potential revenue, average per-unit price, competition levels, and review/rating quality.‍\n\nAnalyzer.Tools does not offer brand research tools.\n\nCompetitor research\n\nSpots competitor best-sellers to sell the same\n\nSeller Assistant offers 2 competitor research tools: Seller Spy and Storefront Widget.\n‍Seller Spy helps track your competitor best-sellers to expand your inventory and adjust your pricing by showing new or removed products, competitor best-sellers, and pricing adjustments.\n‍Storefront Widget provides competitor storefront summary (key categories, brands, ASIN qty, etc.), and key data for each competitor ASIN (you can also do calculations). \n\n‍Analyzer.Tools’ Competing Seller Scan extracts all products from your competitor’s store in a spreadsheet, processed with their Bulk Spreadsheet Scan (you get the same data). This competitor research tool doesn’t show which products were added or removed, and does not provide store summary data.\n\nProduct View\n\nShows key details for each ASIN directly on the Amazon pages\n\nSeller Assistant Extension offers 4 powerful widgets, one of them is Product View. It allows in-depth research on the Amazon product pages for wholesale sellers who need to check single products with warnings, and online arbitrage sellers and dropshippers who do manual research. Product View shows key product metrics with its features: FBM & FBA Calculator, Offers, Variation Viewer, Alerts, Sales Estimator, Stock Checker, Notes, Restriction Checker, and provides search links to Google, eBay, Alibaba, and more. \n\n‍Analyzer.Tools doesn’t offer a solution for research on Amazon product pages. Product details data open only from a spreadsheet in a modal window, and shows limited data (BSR, Buy Box price, sales estimates, Keepa chart, calculator, and limited information about offers and variations).\n\nSide Panel View\n\nAllows quick research on supplier websites\n\nNative Seller Assistant's Side Panel View can be activated on any website, displaying essential product data, alerts, competitor offers, variation data, allows advanced profit calculations, and more. This tool is best for online arbitrage sellers and dropshippers who do advanced research on the supplier websites side-by-side.\n‍\nAnalyzer.Tools doesn’t have research tools on the supplier websites.\n\nQuick View\n\nHelps identify poor/risky deals on Amazon search pages\n\nSeller Assistant's Quick View enables fast product research by showing BSR, competition level, Amazon in the Buy Box, IP alerts, and selling restrictions, showing sellers unsuitable deals directly on Amazon search pages. This tool is best for online arbitrage sellers and dropshippers who want to quickly see what’s worth researching, and what's not.\n\n‍Analyzer.Tools doesn’t have research tools on the Amazon search pages.\n\nReverse Sourcing\n\nAmazon to supplier; you find and research profitable product on Amazon and then look for its supplier\n\nSeller Assistant offers reverse sourcing solutions in 2 ways: for bulk and single products. For bulk products, you grab Amazon products in the chosen subcategory or niche with ASIN Grabber, analyze with Price List Analyzer for the best deals, look for product suppliers, and research with Side Panel View directly on the supplier website. For single products, you open search pages on Amazon, get rid of unsuitable results with Quick View, open the most promising deals, research them, and use Lookup Links to find suppliers.\n‍\nReverse Sourcing tool Analyzer.Tools doesn’t allow research on the Amazon search and product pages. To research, you must separately open a modal window for each product from the spreadsheet offering limited data, then open a product on Amazon, and from there use a Google Lens to search for suppliers. There is no possibility to do analysis on the supplier websites, which is possible in Seller Assistant.\n\nSales estimates\n\nEstimates how many products you can sell\n\nSeller Assistant shows you two sales estimates: the Sales metric forecast product quantity of units you can sell based on BSR, and Sales Estimator shows how many products you can potentially sell  if you add your offer to the listing.\n\n‍Analyzer.Tools only provides sales estimates based on BSR.\n\nVariation Viewer\n\nShows product variation data\n\nSeller Assistant’s Variation Viewer provides more data than Analyzer.Tools and allows to identify best-selling variation by its rating share. It shows variation image, ASIN, price, variation type, variation ratings, total ratings, and rating share.\n\n‍Analyzer.Tools Variation Viewer only displays variation count (in Bulk Spreadsheet Scan), title, image, reviews, and color.\n\nStock Checker\n\nMonitors competitor inventory levels\n\nSeller Assistant’s Stock Checker shows how many units FBA and FBM sellers have in stock.\n\n‍Analyzer.Tools doesn’t have such a feature.\n\nOffers\n\nShows all competitor offers and their data (including Amazon)\n\nSeller Assistant’s Variation Viewer provides more data than Analyzer.Tools and helps estimate your chances of winning the Buy Box share. It shows seller offer prices, conditions, seller types (FBA/FBM), stock, seller names, their Buy Box %, and allows filters in the feature.\n\n‍Analyzer.Tools only shows seller price, condition, seller type (FBA/FBM), seller name, rating, and feedback count.\n\nIP Alerts and Restriction Warnings\n\nAlerts sellers about IP complaints, selling eligibility, product restrictions, and other risks\n\nSeller Assistant’s unique IP Alert extension warns about IP complaints and Amazon policy violations by type and date. It also specifies if you can sell a product on your Amazon account, product restrictions, and flags different product risks: Amazon as seller, hazmat, fragile, heavy and bulky, meltable, adult, generic brand. Price List Analyzer shows additional warnings like too high/too low ROI, etc.\n‍\n‍Analyzer.Tools only shows if brands filed IP complaints and hazmat flag.\n\nProfit Calculator and advanced calculations\n\nCalculates profitability with fees and taxes\n\nSeller Assistant’s FBM and FBA Calculator calculates profit, ROI, margin for FBA and FBM, including VAT and sales tax, Amazon fees, break-even point, and price hints for Amazon repricer.\n\n‍Analyzer.Tools also calculates profit, ROI, margin for FBA and FBM, including VAT, Amazon fees, and break-even point. Doesn’t calculate sales tax, but computes seller proceeds.\n\nVPN Access\n\nSecure browsing for product research\n\nSeller Assistant provides a VPN Chrome extension created specifically for Amazon sellers. It offers safe and unrestricted access to all websites, retailers, and online resources, no matter restrictions or blocks. VPN extension is integrated with Seller Assistant product sourcing software and helps sellers to perform advanced product research, overcome geo-restrictions, and protect their privacy without the need to spend money or install additional VPN tools.\n\n‍Analyzer.Tools doesn't have built-in VPN.\n\nIntegration\n\nConnects to third-party tools via API\n\nSeller Assistant has API integration with 1,000+ API requests per month (expandable).\n\n‍Analyzer.Tools also provides API access.\n\nPartner Integrations\n\nOffers connections with external services\n\nSeller Assistant has integrations with Keepa, Zapier and Make (Airtable, Google Sheets, Notion, Amazon Seller Central)\n‍\nAnalyzer.Tools has integrations with CamelCamelCamel, Keepa.\n\nTeamwork & Virtual Assistants\n\nSecure team collaboration\n\nSeller Assistant offers Virtual Assistant Accounts and teamwork features with secure seller account access.\n‍\n‍Analyzer.Tools doesn't have specific team collaboration or VA features. Employees can leave notes in the Bulk Spreadsheet Scan sheet.\n\nPrice\n\n‍\n\n‍\n\nTRY NOW\nAn Advanced Alternative to  Analyzer Tools\n\nSeller Assistant is an alternative to Analyzer Tools\n\nTry for free\n\nNot sure which plan fits your sourcing workflow? Chat with our team — we're happy to help.\n\nNAVIGATION\nHome\nPricing\nDownload\nSOLUTIONS\nOnline Arbitrage\nWholesale\nDropshipping\nAgencies\nPRODUCTS\nPrice List Analyzer\nLister\nPurchase Orders\nSuppliers\nWarehouses\nSeller Assistant Extension\nIP-Alert by Seller Assistant\nVPN by Seller Assistant\nBulk Restriction Checker\nSeller Spy\nBrand Analyzer\nFREE TOOLS\nASIN Lookup\nIP-Alert Lookup\nSupplier Finder\nASIN to UPC\nUPC to ASIN\nEAN to ASIN\nFEATURES\nFBM & FBA Calculator\nVAT Calculator\nAmazon IP-Alert\nSide Panel View\nAmazon Quick View\nStorefront Widget\nAlerts & Flags\nRestrictions Checker\nSales Estimator\nOffers\nVariation Viewer\nStock Checker\nASIN Grabber\nSub-Accounts for VAs\nExport to Google Sheets\nNotes\nALTERNATIVES\nAnalyzer.Tools Alternative\nScan Unlimited Alternative\nSmartScout Alternative\nRevSeller Alternative\nBuyBotPro Alternative\nAZInsight Alternative\nSellerAmp Alternative\nIP-Alert Alternative\nDS Quick View Alternative\nPARTNERS\nAffiliate Program\nPartners\nAmazon Experts\nPress Kit\nRESOURCES\nBlog\nGet a Demo\nHelp Center\nOffice Hours\nNews & Updates\nProduct Roadmap\nReviews\nINTEGRATIONS\nZapier\nMake\nAirtable\nn8n\nGoogle Sheets\nSeller Central\nPrep Centers\nAPI\nOTHER LINKS\nIP-Alert by Seller Assistant\nLANGUAGE\n🇬🇧 English\n🇷🇺 Русский\n🇪🇸 Español\n🇹🇷 Türkçe\n\nCopyright © 2019-2026 Linen Art, LLC. All rights reserved.\nAmazon and all related marks are trademarks of Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates.\n\nTerms of Use